OL,3,GNEWSAThe football club with a
OL,4,A'child-friendly' approach
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer-led football club that
OL,7,Ffocuses on "the young person's
OL,8,Fexperience in football" has been
OL,9,Fnominated for a BBC Make a Difference
OL,10,FAward.
OL,12,FHuish Tigers FC was started in Taunton
OL,13,Fin 2016 by Gavin Step, who wanted to
OL,14,Fcreate a space for his five-year-old
OL,15,Fson and his friends to have a kickabout
OL,16,Fand practise their skills.
OL,18,FStep works professionally in football
OL,19,Fas a women's technical director and has
OL,20,Fused some of that experience to shape
OL,21,Fhow the club has evolved.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
