OL,3,GNEWSAThe football club with a
OL,4,A'child-friendly' approach
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I thought maybe I had some expertise
OL,7,Fto share and there was maybe an
OL,8,Falternative way that focused on the
OL,9,Fyoung person's experience in football
OL,10,Frather than accelerating them towards
OL,11,Fthe seriousness of adult sport," said
OL,12,FStep.
